ries without permission.","goalFit":["more_clients","better_conversion"],"requiresCapacity":false,"trigger":{"type":"question_below","questionIds":["presence-2","presence-3"],"threshold":100}},{"id":"public-presence-plan","domain":"presence","title":"Decide what public presence your practice needs","summary":"A website is one route. Start with how the right people currently find and contact you.","steps":["List your main referral and discovery routes.","Identify any difficulty finding reliable service and contact information.","Choose the smallest useful public information improvement."],"effort":"One planning session","definitionOfDone":"You have chosen a public-information next step, or documented why no change is currently needed.","verification":"Check whether intended clients can find accurate information through your chosen route.","goalFit":["more_clients","better_conversion","sustainable_practice"],"requiresCapacity":false,"trigger":{"type":"no_website"}},{"id":"intake-owner","domain":"intake","title":"Give every inquiry an owner and a backup","summary":"Make responsibility explicit before adding more demand.","steps":["Choose the person responsible for each inquiry channel.","Agree who covers absences.","Keep one visible queue of inquiries needing a next step."],"effort":"One short team or solo planning session","definitionOfDone":"Each active channel has a named owner, a backup and a shared queue.","verification":"Review a recent period for inquiries without an owner or next step.","goalFit":["more_clients","better_conversion","less_admin"],"requiresCapacity":false,"trigger":{"type":"question_below","questionIds":["intake-1","intake-3"],"threshold":100}},{"id":"response-expectation","domain":"intake","title":"Set and measure a useful response expectation","summary":"Measure substantive help separately from automatic acknowledgments.","steps":["Agree an appropriate expectation by channel and urgency.","Record inquiry time and first useful response.","Review unanswered inquiries and exceptions."],"effort":"A setup session, then a short recurring review","definitionOfDone":"The expectation, owner and timestamp definitions are written down.","verification":"Compare response-time distributions and unanswered counts for the same channels and period.","goalFit":["more_clients","better_conversion"],"requiresCapacity":false,"trigger":{"type":"question_below","questionIds":["intake-2","intake-4"],"threshold":100}},{"id":"service-plan","domain":"service","title":"Give clients a clear plan and update rhythm","summary":"Reduce uncertainty about what happens next.","steps":["Describe the main stages and what the client needs to do.","Agree useful update points.","Check that the explanation makes sense to the client."],"effort":"One template session and a first use","definitionOfDone":"A reusable plan and update approach are in use.","verification":"Review a small set of appropriate engagements for promised updates and repeated questions.","goalFit":["better_conversion","less_admin","sustainable_practice"],"requiresCapacity":false,"trigger":{"type":"question_below","questionIds":["service-1","service-2"],"threshold":100}},{"id":"client-handoffs","domain":"service","title":"Make information requests and closing handovers repeatable","summary":"Use clear checklists to reduce avoidable chasing.","steps":["List the information required at each stage.","Choose a suitable secure collection route.","Create a closing handover with completion and next-step checks."],"effort":"One focused workflow session","definitionOfDone":"The collection checklist and closing handover have accountable owners.","verification":"Check whether repeat requests and missing closing steps decrease.","goalFit":["less_admin","sustainable_practice"],"requiresCapacity":false,"trigger":{"type":"question_below","questionIds":["service-3","service-4"],"threshold":70}},{"id":"fee-expectations","domain":"cash","title":"Explain fees and payment timing before surprises arise","summary":"Use the fee approach appropriate to your services and professional requirements.","steps":["Describe scope, assumptions and reasons costs could change.","Explain when payment is due and the available choices.","Check the client's understanding."],"effort":"One explanation and template review","definitionOfDone":"The fee and payment explanation is clear and consistently used.","verification":"Review common fee questions and unexpected-bill concerns; no client details are needed here.","goalFit":["collect_cash","better_conversion"],"requiresCapacity":false,"trigger":{"type":"question_below","questionIds":["cash-1","cash-2"],"threshold":100}},{"id":"cash-review","domain":"cash","title":"Create a regular invoicing and receivables review","summary":"Give delayed bills and overdue balances an owner and an appropriate next step.","steps":["Confirm the invoicing schedule.","Review an aggregate aging report.","Assign the next step for exceptions and disputes."],"effort":"One setup session and a recurring short review","definitionOfDone":"Invoicing and aging reviews have owners, a cadence and recorded next steps.","verification":"Track billing delays and aging using consistent definitions and a comparable period.","goalFit":["collect_cash","less_admin"],"requiresCapacity":false,"trigger":{"type":"question_below","questionIds":["cash-3","cash-4"],"threshold":100}},{"id":"reduce-admin","domain":"operations","title":"Remove one recurring source of unwanted administration","summary":"Choose a repeated burden that prevents useful work.","steps":["Observe where the same work or information is repeated.","Choose one small process change.","Measure effort and errors before and after."],"effort":"One observation period and a small improvement","definitionOfDone":"One change is in use, with a named way to assess its benefit.","verification":"Compare unwanted work and rework; necessary administration is not a failure.","goalFit":["less_admin","sustainable_practice"],"requiresCapacity":false,"trigger":{"type":"question_below","questionIds":["operations-2","operations-3"],"threshold":100}},{"id":"shared-definitions","domain":"operations","title":"Use shared records and definitions for business decisions","summary":"A simple reliable record is more useful than a complicated inconsistent dashboard.","steps":["Define inquiry, suitable inquiry, consultation, client and payment.","Choose one shared record.","Reconcile stage and financial exceptions at review time."],"effort":"One definition session and a recurring review","definitionOfDone":"Stage definitions and review ownership are recorded and used.","verification":"Check a limited aggregate period for inconsistent counts and unresolved exceptions.","goalFit":["collect_cash","better_conversion","less_admin"],"requiresCapacity":false,"trigger":{"type":"question_below","questionIds":["operations-1","operations-4"],"threshold":100}},{"id":"planned-cover","domain":"independence","title":"Make planned time off workable","summary":"Match coverage and client expectations to the practice you want.","steps":["Identify work that needs coverage during leave.","Agree suitable help and an urgent-contact route.","Communicate availability expectations."],"effort":"A coverage planning session","definitionOfDone":"A practical coverage arrangement and availability message are documented.","verification":"After using the arrangement, review interruptions and unmet needs.","goalFit":["sustainable_practice","less_admin"],"requiresCapacity":false,"trigger":{"type":"question_below","questionIds":["independence-1","independence-2"],"threshold":100}},{"id":"owner-priorities","domain":"independence","title":"Align the next improvement with your own goals","summary":"More staff, tools or clients are not automatically the right outcome.","steps":["Choose the outcome that matters most now.","Select one improvement that supports it.","Review progress and access to essential business accounts."],"effort":"One short planning session","definitionOfDone":"A chosen goal, next action and review point are written down.","verification":"Check progress against your chosen outcome and confirm essential account ownership.","goalFit":["sustainable_practice","less_admin","collect_cash"],"requiresCapacity":false,"trigger":{"type":"question_below","questionIds":["independence-3","independence-4"],"threshold":100}},{"id":"capacity-first","domain":"operations","title":"Resolve the capacity constraint before seeking more work","summary":"Your reported spare capacity is zero or below. Focus on fit, workload and the work you want to keep.","steps":["Identify the work creating the constraint.","Review appropriate delegation, scope and acceptance choices.","Reassess capacity after the change."],"effort":"One workload review","definitionOfDone":"You have chosen a realistic capacity or acceptance change.","verification":"Review workload and service commitments before increasing demand.","goalFit":["more_clients","less_admin","sustainable_practice"],"requiresCapacity":false,"trigger":{"type":"capacity_full"}},{"id":"control-deadline","domain":"operations","title":"Review deadline capture and backup arrangements","summary":"Confirm how deadlines are recorded, checked and covered.","steps":["Confirm applicability and the actual working arrangement.","Review concerns with an appropriately qualified person.","Record the next step and review date without uploading sensitive records."],"effort":"Depends on the control and any remediation","definitionOfDone":"An appropriate owner has reviewed the deadline process and follow-up needs.","verification":"Keep suitable evidence within your firm's own systems; this preview does not certify compliance.","goalFit":[],"requiresCapacity":false,"trigger":{"type":"control","controlId":"deadline"}},{"id":"control-mfa","domain":"operations","title":"Review protection for important accounts","summary":"Check whether suitable multifactor authentication and recovery are in place.","steps":["Confirm applicability and the actual working arrangement.","Review concerns with an appropriately qualified person.","Record the next step and review date without uploading sensitive records."],"effort":"Depends on the control and any remediation","definitionOfDone":"High-risk account protection and recovery arrangements have been reviewed.","verification":"Keep suitable evidence within your firm's own systems; this preview does not certify compliance.","goalFit":[],"requiresCapacity":false,"trigger":{"type":"control","controlId":"mfa"}},{"id":"control-ai_review","domain":"operations","title":"Confirm qualified review of AI legal output","summary":"Check the review process before relying on AI-generated legal work.","steps":["Confirm applicability and the actual working arrangement.","Review concerns with an appropriately qualified person.","Record the next step and review date without uploading sensitive records."],"effort":"Depends on the control and any remediation","definitionOfDone":"The practice has a clear qualified-review process appropriate to its AI use.","verification":"Keep suitable evidence within your firm's own systems; this preview does not certify compliance.","goalFit":[],"requiresCapacity":false,"trigger":{"type":"control","controlId":"ai_review"}},{"id":"control-client_funds","domain":"cash","title":"Review applicable client-funds reconciliation","summary":"Use appropriate qualified help to confirm the applicable process and any discrepancies.","steps":["Confirm applicability and the actual working arrangement.","Review concerns with an appropriately qualified person.","Record the next step and review date without uploading sensitive records."],"effort":"Depends on the control and any remediation","definitionOfDone":"The applicable reconciliation process and follow-up owner have been confirmed.","verification":"Keep suitable evidence within your firm's own systems; this preview does not certify compliance.","goalFit":[],"requiresC